    },
    {
      "displayText": "Salut ! Dis, est-ce que tu as un type de Pokémon\npréféré ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006C00750074002000210020004400690073002C0020006500730074002D00630065002000710075006500200074007500200061007300200075006E0020007400790070006500200064006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A0070007200E9006600E9007200E90020003F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi, celui que je préfère, c’est le type Fée,\nsans aucune hésitation !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon kimono a été confectionné par une célèbre\ncouturière spécialisée dans le type Fée, vois-tu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et comme j’adore tout ce qu’elle fait,\nje suis évidemment fan du type Fée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs... je me demande lequel de nos types\npréférés est le plus fort.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir si tu veux que l’on compare\nle potentiel de nos types préférés.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moi mon truc, c’est le type Fée !\nJe te mets au défi d’affronter mon équipe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’accord !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00442019006100630063006F00720064002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je dois d’abord me préparer...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200064006F0069007300200064201900610062006F007200640020006D006500200070007200E900700061007200650072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prépare une équipe de ton type favori...\nou mélange plusieurs types, si tu préfères !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allons-y !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F006E0073002D00790020002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il existe un type qui n’a aucun effet sur\nle type Fée. On va voir si tu sais lequel c’est !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
